OL,3,GNEWSA'Leicester draw is game for the
OL,4,Afans and for Dover'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe manager of non-league Dover
OL,7,FAthletic says the club's FA Cup draw
OL,8,Fagainst former Premier League champions
OL,9,FLeicester City is "a game for the fans
OL,10,Fand for the town".
OL,12,FManager Jake Leberl described it as an
OL,13,F"unbelievable draw".
OL,15,F"[I'm] so pleased for everyone - the
OL,16,Fchairman who's been here so many years
OL,17,Fpumping money in, the new investors,
OL,18,Fand the fans who've had it hard for
OL,19,Fquite a few years," he said.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
