OL,3,GNEWSA'Leicester draw is game for the
OL,4,Afans and for Dover'
OL,5,
OL,6,FChairman of the sixth division side,
OL,7,FJim Parmenter, told BBC Radio Kent:
OL,8,F"This is just one off in every 10
OL,9,Fyears."
